OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,CResident doctors begin 24-hour strike  
OL,5,Cover pay                               
OL,6,GResident doctors have returned to the  
OL,7,Gpicket lines on Friday in a strike     
OL,8,Gover pay.                              
OL,10,FThey are holding a full 24-hour strike 
OL,11,Fwhich began at 07:00 GMT, marking      
OL,12,Ftheir second such action this year.    
OL,14,FBritish Medical Association (BMA)      
OL,15,Fmembers voted in favour of industrial  
OL,16,Faction after the union rejected a      
OL,17,Frecommended 3.5% pay rise from an      
OL,18,Findependent pay body.                  
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
