OL,3,W"###"###"###T//,/,--.,-.,,-,-.,-.-.,,//
OL,4,C'Better results for patients' since    
OL,5,CSWAH surgery suspended, says health    
OL,6,Cchief                                  
OL,7,GThere is a question mark over whether  
OL,8,Grestoring emergency general surgery at 
OL,9,Gthe South West Acute Hospital (SWAH)   
OL,10,Gin Enniskillen "is the right thing to  
OL,11,Gdo", according to the chief executive  
OL,12,Gof the Western Health Trust.           
OL,14,FKaren Hargan told Stormont's Health    
OL,15,FCommittee that there had been "better  
OL,16,Foutcomes for patients" since the       
OL,17,Fservice was withdrawn - and that       
OL,18,Freinstating it would come at a         
OL,19,Fsubstantial financial cost.            
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
